OL,3,GNEWSABadenoch urges PM to overturn ban
OL,4,Aon new licences as gas drilling gets
OL,5,Ago-ahead at Jackdaw
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch calls
OL,8,Fon PM Andy Burnham to overturn Labour's
OL,9,Fban on all new oil and gas licences,
OL,10,Ffollowing the decision to allow
OL,11,Fdrilling at Jackdaw gas field
OL,13,FDuring PMQs, Badenoch accuses the
OL,14,Fgovernment of "dithering" over the
OL,15,Fdecision for years - but Burnham says
OL,16,Fministers have made a call the Tories
OL,17,F"messed up" when they were in power
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
