OL,3,GNEWSABadenoch urges PM to overturn ban
OL,4,Aon new licences as gas drilling gets
OL,5,Ago-ahead at Jackdaw
OL,6,
OL,7,FEnvironmentalists argue more drilling
OL,8,Fwill hamper efforts to cut
OL,9,Fplanet-warming carbon emissions, and
OL,10,Fthat the government should transition
OL,11,Fsooner to greener technologies
OL,13,FJackdaw was approved by the
OL,14,FConservatives in 2022, but was delayed
OL,15,Fby legal challenges - here's a brief
OL,16,Fhistory and here's a reminder of UK and
OL,17,FScottish net zero targets
